# Infrastructure

- External resources stay in Infra: Cosmos, blob, Data Lake, Service Bus, Auth, Backend adapters.
- Honor interfaces defined in Core; inject implementations at the composition root.
- `Backend.*` HintPath DLLs under `..\..\Binaries\` are an external dependency — do not rename those assemblies.
- Notification adapters are infrastructure-adjacent; no campaign/journey business rules here.
- Infra-only changes may use a graph waiver or `meaningOptional` path-map entries when product meaning does not change.
